          (reference "J403") 
          (unit 1))))) 
  (text "Half-duplex TTL: 1G126 drives DATA from UART2_TX (OE=DXL_DIR high), 1G125 reads DATA into UART2_RX (/OE=DXL_DIR low). R310 pulls DXL_DIR low at boot so the board listens. One bus, two EH sockets, no RS485." 
    (at 35 35 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.3 1.3)) 
      (justify left)) 
    (uuid "4d193a5b-84f2-570c-99ac-394e20d1fa69")) 
  (text "EH pin order: 1=GND, 2=VBAT, 3=DATA. R309 (0R) is the battery-to-servo branch. UART2 is the boot console until disabled in software." 
    (at 35 145 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.3 1.3)) 
      (justify left)) 
    (uuid "aed8f7c4-f029-50d8-a376-29622c73fb66")) 
  (embedded_fonts no))
